<Project Sdk="Uno.Sdk">

  <!-- Uno 데스크톱 데모. WPF·OpenSilver 데모와 같은 화면 구성과 ViewModel을 쓴다. -->

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0-desktop</TargetFrameworks>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <UnoSingleProject>true</UnoSingleProject>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <ApplicationTitle>DemoUnoApp</ApplicationTitle>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Jamesnet.Platform.Uno\Jamesnet.Platform.Uno.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
